Rule 2 (Second argument y must be an integer or boolean tensor)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5
>>
Rule 3 (Tensor shapes must be compatible for elementwise broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 7 (Both tensor operands must have integer or boolean dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5
